### 1.1 Terrain Types (enum)
```python
class TerrainType(Enum):
    PLAINS = "Plains"
    HILLS = "Hills"
    FOREST = "Forest"
    MOUNTAIN = "Mountain"
    TUNDRA = "Tundra"
    DESERT = "Desert"
    MARSH = "Marsh"
    OCEAN = "Ocean"
    COAST = "Coast"
```

