## Changes Made

### 1. `map.py` — Fog of War Fix (lines 26-41)
**Bug**: `ImprovedFogOfWar.is_visible()` inherited from the base `FogOfWar` class which checked `self.discovered` instead of `self.visible`. This meant fog-of-war visibility always showed everything ever discovered, not just what's currently visible.

**Fix**: 
- Added `is_visible()` override that checks `self.visible` (the current visibility set) instead of `self.discovered` (the permanent discovered set)
- Added bounds check `if (nq, nr) in self.tiles` in `update_visibility()` to prevent adding out-of-bounds tiles

### 2. `ui.py` — Typed Command Parser (new file, complete rewrite)
**Added**: `CommandParser` class with 25+ typed commands:

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `map [zoom]` | View map with optional zoom |
| `city <name>` | Show city details |
| `unit <name>` | Show unit details |
| `research <tech>` | Start researching a tech |
| `research tree` | Show tech tree |
| `produce <city> unit <name>` | Queue unit production |
| `produce <city> building <name>` | Queue building production |
| `build <district> <city>` | Build a district |
| `diplomacy [civ] [war\|peace\|ally]` | Diplomacy actions |
| `status` | Empire overview |
| `info` | Character/dynasty info |
| `help [cmd]` | Command help |

**Also added keyboard shortcuts**: `m` (map), `c` (cities), `u` (units), `r` (research), `p` (production), `d` (diplomacy), `e` (events), `n`/`f5` (next turn), `s` (save)

